00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.680
All current Tesla models received the seasonal feature.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:37.500
5 custom Tesla builds are heading to the X takeover at Giga, Texas. Owners prepared multiple

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:42.200
unique modifications for the weekend event. Video showed a passenger trapped while a

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:47.120
cyber cab circled a parking lot repeatedly. The incident happened in an uncontrolled setting.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:53.320
Tesla has not issued a statement on that footage. Tesla registered 150 cyber cabs in Texas

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:59.380
in a single day. The total in the state nearly doubled to 319. A recent poll found nearly

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:05.040
